--- !u!114 &61353005
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 61352999}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 123c0a5786befa64eacf1a8a113e041e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  backGround: {fileID: 1932446894}
  musicManager: {fileID: 61353004}
  sfxManager: {fileID: 1932446896}
  dialogueLines:
  - name: Siea
    lines: Once upon a time... On a snow-covered planet, there was a god whose light
      shined as bright as hope for humanity.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1e4ec811957b1c447b3f24f1eaa40031, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"Arva" is the name for said god, or with another name..."God of Sunlight
      and Agricultural". Every human loved Arva. Conversely, Arva has a brother called;
      "Nokru" known for their dark sorcerey and curses.'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: Of course, human faith is never equal, Arva recieved blessings and worshippings,
      while in Nokru's name was cursed and seen as the harbinger of disasters.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 54eba7abb21282c4ab277ab1d5402d0b, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: Nokru's jealousy eventually boiled over his brother, leading to infleunce
      his own follower to despise the opposing side.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: My name is Siea, sole child of the chieftain who leads those who follow
      Lord Nokru. Brave, pure, and divine. Lord Nokru has granted me the gift of
      sorcerey. My reverence for him runs as deep as the love for my mother and father.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5fa799b46c124b8428c059c812d1f1d3, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: Before I was born into the family, the tribe of Arva's followers invaded
      our settlement. They massacred the people with no remorse. And it made me furious.
      I hate them, as spiteful as Lord Nokru.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: A black tatto is mandatory to have at the back of every Lord Nokru's followers'
      palm. We raised our hand and show our tattoo, as a gesture of greeting.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: SIea
    lines: I am now 18 years of age, serving as the village's with apprentice sorcerer.
      I was sent out from my village to hone my skill. But when I returned....
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: SIea
    lines: My village was desolated of its own people. There was a blood-stained
      note saying to go hide in the woods.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 6518ffefd5211124bae6640537a46b5b, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: SIea
    lines: Maybe... my parents could be hiding in there too, but my guts are telling
      the opposite.. Please, don't let anything happen to them...
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1055405697}
  nameComponent: {fileID: 1206130655}
  textSpeed: 0.025
  textBox: {fileID: 1990091806}
  target1: {fileID: 1961765733}
  target2: {fileID: 1871435807}
  smoothPopup: 0.125
  _popUp: 0
  lineCount: 0
  goodEnding: 0
